{"timestamp":"2026-11-16T10:53:45.915Z","ordinal":35,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1e3dd-7cb9-7810-8ff2-bc0c305a5490","turn_id":"01a1e3fd-53d9-7121-8251-b27b19d1b977","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_04add847ea339ec5016afae0b8cf1c87d0a932bc710b33253b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"下面的单选框缺少“男、女”文字，是因为 [character7/index.html](/Users/oyamahappa/Documents/GitHub/labs/WebDesignCourse/character7/index.html:47) 中：\n\n- `value=\"男\"` 表示提交表单时发送的值，不会显示在旁边。\n- `radio` 不支持 `placeholder`。\n- 两个 `id=\"gender2\"` 重复，需要分别命名。\n\n像上面那组一样，添加 `<label>` 就可以：\n\n```html\n<input type=\"radio\" id=\"male2\" name=\"gender2\" value=\"男\" required>\n<label for=\"male2\">男</label>\n\n<input type=\"radio\" id=\"female2\" name=\"gender2\" value=\"女\" required>\n<label for=\"female2\">女</label>\n```\n\n`name` 相同表示同一组，只能选一个；`label` 的 `for` 对应各自的 `id`，点击文字也能选中。\n\n已核对截图和源码，未修改文件或重新运行页面。"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1794826424986,"completed_at_ms":1794826425915}}
